-- F-kids StatePF walk: port of Tools.ShippingGen4KWalkEmit to `KeepsCS` (the K walk with the circuit state tracked). Takes `MemoFamily` as a HYPOTHESIS `M`; adds NO premise, NO law, NO axiom. No `sorry`, no `native_decide`. Generated by renaming, then fixed by hand where the state matters.
-- (copies of ShippingChildFallbackA 96-325), with `StableK` instead of `StableA`.

