  · exact translateConcatActsKS M hA hS _ _ _ (emitConcatConstKS M hA hS _ _) (hrec _ _ _ _) _ _
  · exact translateConcatActsKS M hA hS _ _ _ (hrec _ _ _ _) (emitConcatConstKS M hA hS _ _) _ _

